Error [E0385]: this declaration uses the retired `name: Type = value` default spelling.
  --> tests/ui/default_shape_retired.jet:2:19
    |
  2 | fn old(limit: Int = 30) Int -> limit
    |                   ^
 Why: declaration defaults ride the type as `name: Type{value}`; `=` remains for reassignment and extern slot fill.
 Fix: write `name: Type{value}` for a declaration default, or keep `=` for reassignment and extern slot fill.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0385

